  <item>
    <title>#21 慢下来的底气：20来岁就成为集团战略总监，人生路口选择裸辞当妈、做自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666f1724c26e396a363793c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666f1724c26e396a363793c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Jun 2024 16:47:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>从头部咨询公司的项目经理，到20来岁就成为大型金融集团的战略总监、高管助理，如何在甲乙两方都能游刃有余、实现职场速通？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>极快的成长，总是伴随着极高的压力，以及速度的盛景下也无法掩盖的迷茫与疲惫。如何指引自己做出不后悔的决策？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>鲜花着锦之时选择怀孕生娃、裸辞轻创业，女性职场人怎样过出最想要的人生？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> </span><strong><span>快车道的压力必然拉满：</span></strong><span>休长假、放慢节奏都只是止痛药，唯一解法就是离开这里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> </span><strong><span>甲方的好处和挑战：</span></strong><span>都是与人打交道，但真的，别再乙里乙气了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="755">12:35</a> </span><strong><span>3个空降兵水土不服的原因：</span></strong><span>侵入者，增加负担，带来变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="847">14:07</a></span><strong><span> 3个甲方空降tips：</span></strong><span>搞明白定位和KPI，从服务心态转变为协同心态，尊重行业专家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1136">18:56</a> </span><strong><span>咨询/战略人的5层境界</span></strong><span>（王亚军版）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1207">20:07</a> </span><strong><span>跳槽犹豫不决：</span></strong><span>没有完美的新工作，选择相对最能接受的就好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> </span><strong><span>职场黄金期怀孕生娃：</span></strong><span>需要有足够的安全感，但依然会有FOMO时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2102">35:02</a> </span><strong><span>新晋宝妈重回职场：</span></strong><span>非常非常辛苦，加班和亲子时间都不能少，出差也会担心孩子受到分离创伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2345">39:05</a> </span><strong><span>裸辞轻创业：</span></strong><span>做好了三个月收入极低的准备。大胆而理性的决策，需要家人支持和财务规划来给足安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2960">49:20</a> </span><strong><span>给女孩儿们的3个建议：</span></strong><span>选择女性友好的平台，不能“既要又要”，职场马拉松慢慢来</span></p><span></span><p><span>附：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp48x3p8Agqx7I5mZXZIJ1dYaAhQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片来自小红书博主卷心菜周女士，内容出处据说为前麦肯锡大神王亚军</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>钰姐 (</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_l2taFQH5h-uNncdmtxhkg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_l2taFQH5h-uNncdmtxhkg"><span>公众号@行走的红帽帽</span></a><span>)，裸辞轻创业ing，前大型金融集团战略总监、高管助理，前头部咨询公司项目经理</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韦嗯 (小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638"><span>@最近有在好好干饭的胃泥</span></a><span>)，《没豌没了》主播，消费行业战略分析师、高管助理，前咨询顾问</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>音乐采样</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>夏日物语—卓越</span></p><span></span><p><span>Summer is coming！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号“WonderPeers豌豆派”会发布本频道所有节目相关信息及咨询行业职场干货，欢迎关注~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>vx搜索“Wayne_ENTP”添加韦嗯为好友，拉你进没豌没了听友群哦~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划及制作：韦嗯</span></p>]]></description>
