  <item>
    <title>#20 上岸 2：自我觉察而非顺流而下，上岸顶级运动品牌的市调人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6644791482b428eafdc30d86</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6644791482b428eafdc30d86</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 08:57:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>洞察了那么多品牌、用户，那自己呢？动机和惯性，你被什么驱动？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 从市调公司到顶级运动品牌的INTJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 三大市调公司：尼尔森Nielsen、益普索Ipsos、凯度Kantar每年招多少应届生？隔年还能剩下多少呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="244">04:04</a> 都说市调公司项目程式化严重，你会觉得无聊吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a> 市调公司的exit：甲方多的是用研、洞察、产品经理，乙方有MBB（的特殊部门），此外市调特别欢迎二进宫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="871">14:31</a> 为什么更喜欢甲方？：更能知道自己在干什么，由动机驱动而不是惯性驱动</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 会后悔做乙方吗？：打基础，而且使得我现在贼会压榨乙方（不是</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 来甲方后很痛苦的瞬间：之前从未做过的活儿+需要背责，麻中麻；乙方都是熟练工+老板兜底</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">27:17</a> 来甲方后很爽的瞬间：内购、福利待遇、人文关怀、非常合理的裁员大礼包（？）</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>七七，从三大市调公司到顶级运动品牌，目前被裁次数为0，整个人状态非常好！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韦嗯 (小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638"><span>@最近有在好好干饭的胃泥</span></a><span>)，《没豌没了》主播，消费民企战略分析师、前咨询顾问</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>音乐采样</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>fly 飞—anu</span></p><span></span><p><span>七七挑了一首来自说唱组合anu的藏语说唱。anu，读作阿怒，在藏语里意思是“少年”</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号“WonderPeers豌豆派”会发布本频道所有节目相关信息及咨询行业职场干货，欢迎关注~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>vx搜索“Wayne_ENTP”添加韦嗯为好友，拉你进没豌没了听友群哦~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划及制作：韦嗯</span></p>]]></description>
