    <title>#19 职场Mindset：你给自己做过职场战略规划吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ffe5f62d9eae5d0aaed169</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ffe5f62d9eae5d0aaed169</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Mar 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>调研认知-问题聚焦-使命愿景-定位目标-路径举措-能力支撑</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9">00:09</a> 职场与生活的比重：新人小卷王，国企设计院的ENFP和外资投行的ENFJ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 职场Mindset是什么：职场认知理解+职场破题思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 重新定位：读书时只需要以自己为中心把事做好，工作后是一个不太重要的过程影响因素</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a> 如何沟通：你和老板的沟通频率？老板是甩手掌柜还是细节狂魔？多数情况下职场新人要好好学习老板的思路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> 从外资投行的职场体系聊起：不同阶段都有不同的价值贡献点，做好当下+提前思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 给自己做战略规划：在职场issue tree里砍掉不那么合适的路径，从为了理想工作改造自己，到根据现在的自己找到更匹配的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">18:10</a> 职场战略定力：追风口还是坚持自己的路？构筑自己的能力内核</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 你思考过职场终局嘛？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1743">29:03</a> 大厂leader还是小老板？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1845">30:45</a> Q1快结束了，你的新年职场愿望是什么？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>Lora，好像有点二次元的国企设计院新人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Kenny，似乎很擅于面试的外资投行初级分析员</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韦嗯 (小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638"><span>@最近有在好好干饭的胃泥</span></a><span>)，《没豌没了》主播，消费民企战略分析师、前咨询顾问</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>音乐采样</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Monday—窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><span>周一周一，大脑宕机！周一开会，昏昏欲睡！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天是，忙day哦！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号“WonderPeers豌豆派”会发布本频道所有节目相关信息及咨询行业职场干货，欢迎关注~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>vx搜索“Wayne_ENTP”添加韦嗯为好友，拉你进没豌没了听友群哦~</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划及制作：韦嗯</span></p>]]></description>
