    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>谁还没为跳槽、转行叹过气呢</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="328">05:28</a> 考虑因素的两大维度：意义价值和实操难度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">5:05</a> 被现实乱锤的职场牛马表示，追求“成长”的热血理想没毛病，但吗喽的命也是命，还是得考虑现实因素，何况工资水平也是对个人及行业价值的体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 千金难买想清楚：搜集充足信息后再决策是咨询人的共性习惯，但也是一把双刃剑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 两个tips：不要总是找相同背景的朋友聊；要多和做过类似甚至相反人生选择的前辈聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 多尝试，少内耗，稳住自己的内核价值，解决核心诉求</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1723">28:43</a> 两个决策小工具：影响因素排序对照，负面事件计数打勾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1961">32:41</a> 别怕，正视自己的需求，正视自己的独特</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>荒野，(小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/604a4d14000000000101fbca?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1698594994" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/604a4d14000000000101fbca?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1698594994"><span>@人生是荒野</span></a><span> ，</span><a href="http://xhslink.com/hWJ2Yv" data-url="http://xhslink.com/hWJ2Yv"><span>点击可见本期节目复盘</span></a><span>)，前地产从业者，在职咨询顾问</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>韦嗯(小红书</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5d0c40890000000011023a12?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5d0c40890000000011023a12&amp;apptime=1665470638"><span>@最近有在好好干饭的胃泥</span></a><span>)，《没豌没了》主播，在职咨询顾问<