    <description><![CDATA[<ul><span>  </span><li><span>本期我们邀请到了</span><strong><span>来自OliverWyman奥纬咨询非常资深的顾问H学长</span></strong><span>，来聊一聊有关于咨询PTA的相关话题（走过路过，不要错过哦~）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>PTA又称为兼职助理，是咨询公司针对在校学生的日常实习项目。如果志在校招进入咨询行业，候选人应至少有一段PTA实习经历已成共识。而人力、智力需求越来越大的咨询公司，也更是离不开了靠谱的PTA大军们，因而纷纷开启了各自的PTA program，并且增加了招聘频次</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期内容</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> OW PTA的详细介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="171">02:51</a> OW PTA日常的工作内容是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> in-pool PTA 和 out-pool PTA 的区别有哪些 OW更倾向in-pool PTA哦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="417">06:57</a>申请PTA的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a>申请准备中的那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a>点击此处，解锁“简历修改秘籍”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a>这里有一份“PTA面试宝典”等待查收</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a>面试官偏好？我们可以展开讲讲</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期嘉宾</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>H学长：OW公司资深咨询顾问</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Crystal</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>音乐采样</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Dreamy Acoustic</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号“WonderPeers豌豆派”会发布本频道所有节目相关信息及咨询行业职场干货，欢迎关注~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>vx搜索“Wayne_ENTP”添加韦嗯为好友，拉你进没豌没了听友群，以及和咨询打工人们一起抱团取暖哦~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>欢迎提供任何意见与有趣选题，以及成为嘉宾！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期制作</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>策划及制作：Crystal</span></p>]]></description>
